    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d276">

                <pb facs="0273" n="267" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg267"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Braida to Mr.
                            Uhl.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bluefields</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-31"><hi rendition="#italic">March 31, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received April 11.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to inclose herewith correspondence
                    with the British vice-consul in regard to the formation of a provisional
                    Government for the Mosquito Reserve, and my note to Gen. C. A. Lacayo in
                    reference to the same.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">S. C. Braida.</hi></signed></closer>




